 @host = http://localhost:5161
@tokenTest = {{loginTest.response.body.$.token}}
@tokenTest2 = {{loginTest2.response.body.$.token}}

### 1. Ro'yxatdan o'tish (test) -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "test", "password": "123456" }

### 2. Ro'yxatdan o'tish (test2) -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "test2", "password": "123456" }

### 3. Kirish (test) -> 200
# @name loginTest
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "test", "password": "123456" }

### 4. Kirish (test2) -> 200
# @name loginTest2
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "test2", "password": "123456" }

### 5. Noto'g'ri parol -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "test", "password": "wrong" }

### 6. Janrlar ro'yxati -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/genres

### 7. Albomlar ro'yxati -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/albums

### 8. Tokensiz albom yaratish -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/albums
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Thriller", "artist": "Michael Jackson", "year": 1982,
  "trackCount": 9, "durationMinutes": 42, "genreId": 2 }

### 9. Token bilan albom yaratish -> 201
# @name createAlbum
POST {{host}}/api/albums
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTest}}

{ "title": "Thriller", "artist": "Michael Jackson", "year": 1982,
  "trackCount": 9, "durationMinutes": 42, "genreId": 2 }

### 10. Validatsiya xatosi (davomiylik < treklar soni) -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/albums
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTest}}

{ "title": "Test", "artist": "Test", "year": 2020,
  "trackCount": 9, "durationMinutes": 5, "genreId": 2 }

### 11. Oxirgi yaratilgan albom -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/albums/{{createAlbum.response.body.$.id}}

### 12. Muqova yuklash (cover.png fayli shu papkada bo'lishi kerak) -> 200
POST {{host}}/api/albums/{{createAlbum.response.body.$.id}}/cover
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTest}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cover.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./cover.png
------Boundary--

### 13. Boshqa foydalanuvchi muqova yuklamoqchi -> 403
POST {{host}}/api/albums/{{createAlbum.response.body.$.id}}/cover
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTest2}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cover.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./cover.png
------Boundary--

### 14. Boshqa foydalanuvchi o'chirmoqchi -> 403
DELETE {{host}}/api/albums/{{createAlbum.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTest2}}

### 15. Muallif o'zgartiradi -> 204
PUT {{host}}/api/albums/{{createAlbum.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTest}}

{ "title": "Thriller (Deluxe)", "artist": "Michael Jackson", "year": 1982,
  "trackCount": 9, "durationMinutes": 45, "genreId": 2 }

### 16. Sahifalash -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/albums?page=1&pageSize=2

### 17. Filtr: janr -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/albums?genreId=2

### 18. Filtr: ijrochi -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/albums?artist=jackson

### 19. Filtr: yil -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/albums?year=1982

### 20. Saralash: yil bo'yicha kamayish -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/albums?sort=year&dir=desc

### 21. Saralash: davomiylik bo'yicha o'sish -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/albums?sort=duration&dir=asc

### 22. Muallif albomni o'chiradi (eng oxirida yuboring) -> 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/albums/{{createAlbum.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTest}}

### 23. Mavjud emas -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/albums/999999